{
    desc => 'Ctrl-G on unnamed buffer shows [No Name]',
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/ctrl_g_no_name`

Tests that `Ctrl-g` on an unnamed buffer displays `[No Name]` in the
file info message along with line count and cursor position.

Keys: `Ctrl-g`

- **ctrl_g_no_name_initial.png**: Normal mode, cursor at line 1 col 0, no filename set.
- **ctrl_g_no_name_after_ctrl_g.png**: Mode label shows `[No Name]` with line count and position info.
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('Control-g');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_ctrl_g');
    },
}
__DATA__
unnamed buffer content
